    <data key="d0">ASUN Ingestion and Processing Architecture for Compliant Pharma AI</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uhrheMJTV4A</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for ingesting global pharmaceutical manufacturing data into AWS using IoT Core, Kinesis, Lambda, DynamoDB, OpenSearch, S3, Glue, Athena, and API Gateway.</data>
